    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "plRuby 让 Ruby 成为 PostgreSQL 的过程语言",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 的过程语言家族又多了一位成员。Command Prompt 发布 plRuby，把 MRI Ruby 3.x 解释器嵌进后端，用 CREATE EXTENSION 安装，支持普通函数、集合返回函数、触发器、事件触发器和带事务控制的存储过程，覆盖 PostgreSQL 11 到 18。数据库访问经 SPI，支持游标流式读取和预备语句。它是非受信语言，没有沙箱，只有超级用户能安装。",
      "url": "https://pgsql.cc/about/news/plruby-3345/",
      "author": "Command Prompt, Inc",
      "source": "PostgreSQL 新闻",
      "source_date": "2026-07-31",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "扩展",
        "过程语言",
        "Ruby"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "extension_control_path 把扩展从服务器镜像里拆出来",
      "summary": "PG18 之前，扩展的控制文件写死在 $sharedir/extension 下，没法和服务器镜像分开打包。pgEdge 的 Muhammad Aqeel 说明 extension_control_path 补上了缺口，与 dynamic_library_path 配对。他把扩展分成四类：pgvector 这类按需加载可热挂载，pgaudit 需重启但能独立版本化，pg_cron 收益有限，深度集成的一类拆不开真正的耦合。",
      "url": "https://www.pgedge.com/blog/postgresql-18-s-extension_control_path-decoupling-extensions-from-server-images",
      "author": "Muhammad Aqeel",
      "source": "pgEdge 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-07-31",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL 18",
        "扩展",
        "容器"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "COUNT(DISTINCT) 太慢时的三条近似路线",
      "summary": "精确去重计数在大表上代价高，但不是所有场景都需要精确。Elizabeth Garrett Christensen 对比三条路：TABLESAMPLE 取样 10% 只要 217 毫秒，但去重计数高估约 730%；postgresql-hll 的 HyperLogLog 用时 320 毫秒、误差 0.6%，草图可合并，预聚合后查七日去重用户只要 4 毫秒；DataSketches 的 CPC 误差 1.1%。财务与合规仍应走精确值。",
      "url": "https://www.snowflake.com/en/blog/engineering/postgres-count-distinct-approximation/",
      "author": "Elizabeth Garrett Christensen",
      "source": "Snowflake 工程博客",
      "source_date": "2026-07-31",
      "image": "https://www.snowflake.com/content/dam/snowflake-site/engineering-blog/featured-images/sf-eng-blog-ML-4-1.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "近似统计",
        "HyperLogLog",
        "性能"
      ],
      "position": 3
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 把几件本要靠外部工具的事收回 SQL",
      "summary": "大版本的亮点常被大特性占满，Shaun Thomas 挑的是几处补齐日常缺口的小改动。random() 新增接受上下界的重载，时间类型可直接返回 DATE、TIMESTAMP 或 TIMESTAMPTZ，不必再套一层转换。pg_get_role_ddl() 能取出角色的属性、按角色设置和成员关系，不再需要调 pg_dumpall；pg_get_tablespace_ddl() 与 pg_get_database_ddl() 同理。",
      "url": "https://www.pgedge.com/blog/looking-forward-to-postgres-19-the-cult-of-functionality",
      "author": "Shaun Thomas",
      "source": "pgEdge 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-07-31",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL 19",
        "DDL",
        "函数"
      ],
      "position": 4
